    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1	300- (including 30 women) young people Improved knowledge and skills of youth in urban and rural areas of Tajikistan 
1.1.1 3- educational and vocational training institutions have been equipped with modern equipment to ensure improved educational facilities. 
1.1.2. 10-(including 35% women), covered by internship programs in public and private sector companies during education process. 
1.2. 100-(including 30% women) young people took part in training programs to acquire employment skills. 
1.2.1. 2-production facilities established 
1.2.2. 10-new jobs created for youth (including 35% young women). 
1.3. 27- young innovators presented business ideas withing the Startup Choihona at least 2 ideas received seed funding. 
1.3.1. 1-Entrepreneurship development fund established to support startups, at least 2 startups received support but the fund.</narrative>
    </description>
